  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to Crisis Management Initiative 2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Verksamhetsst&#xf6;d till Crisis Management Initiative (CMI) 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution supports the global activities of CMI. It consists of five mutually reinforcing components that are applied at the national, regional, and global levels: (I) Dialogue and mediation; (II) Mediation support; (III) Support to national peace actors; (IV) Women in peacebuilding; (V) Policy, innovation, and learning. The contribution is earmarked for ODA-eligible activities.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Verksamhetsst&#xf6;d till CMI:s globala verksamhet best&#xe5;r av fem &#xf6;msesidigt f&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkande komponenter som appliceras i insatser p&#xe5; nationell, regional och global niv&#xe5;; (I) Dialog och medling; (II) Medlingsst&#xf6;d; (III) St&#xf6;d till nationella fredsakt&#xf6;rer; (IV) Kvinnor i fredsbyggande; (V) Policy, innovation och l&#xe4;rande. St&#xf6;det &#xe4;r &#xf6;ronm&#xe4;rkt f&#xf6;r ODA-f&#xe4;hig verksamhet.</narrative>
  </description>
